  "item_short_desc": "<p>Our Canvas Barracks Bag is designed to conveniently store and transport a soldier&rsquo;s belongings, clothes, and gear. These canvas bags feature military-styled stenciling for a rugged look and feel. They&rsquo;re great for field use, travel, outdoor adventures, gym going, laundry, and more!</p>",
