  "description": "<p>Our Canvas Barracks Bag is designed to conveniently store and transport a soldier&rsquo;s belongings, clothes, and gear. These canvas bags feature military-styled stenciling for a rugged look and feel. They&rsquo;re great for field use, travel, outdoor adventures, gym going, laundry, and more! Dependable &amp; Long-Lasting: Made of heavy-duty cotton canvas, these army barracks bags are built tough and easily withstand numerous trips, including event-filled days at camp or a weekend getaway through the mountains. The canvas fabric ensures clean clothes won&rsquo;t pick up stray soil or smell from dirty laundry, allowing you to pack everything together in a larger pack as you travel. Drawstring Closure: These canvas laundry bags come equipped with a drawstring top with a cord lock for easy access while ensuring your belongings are safe and secure. Multiple Sizes Available: Our Canvas Barracks Bags come in 3 sizes: Medium (18 inch x 27 inch), Large (24 inch x 32 inch), and Extra Large (30 inch x 40 inch). Top Grade Canvas: Made from Rothco&rsquo;s durable heavyweight canvas fabric, this superior material is naturally water-resistant, rugged, and is built for the long haul. No one comes close to Rothco&rsquo;s collection of premium canvas bags and packs.</p>",
